# Python
# NOTE: Docker matches these with filepath.Match, which is ROOT-ANCHORED — unlike
# .gitignore, a bare `__pycache__/` would only exclude the one at the repo root.
# The `**/` prefix is required to keep nested caches (which embed build-machine
# absolute paths in their .pyc headers) out of the image.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
